[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 13800.269, "timestamp": "03:50:00", "text": "のように"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13804.63, "timestamp": "03:50:04", "text": "そのコーポ、コーポ、コーポのようなコーポ"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13807.51, "timestamp": "03:50:07", "text": "事態は本当に異常だ。とても奥深く、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13810.389, "timestamp": "03:50:10", "text": "だから、それにはたくさんの要素があるけれど、でもまた"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 13812.247, "timestamp": "03:50:12", "author": "@S4bOTh", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/dwyGFV5nV4j6B4rbXTQnxbALJAtFrkvLLYXpy4kpbik67Arf3Y7OK8dSERSwTEtgKPyQeDTq-w=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "Did you ever collabed with yuyu ?"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13812.55, "timestamp": "03:50:12", "text": "あまり多くの人が話すことを許されていない"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13815.99, "timestamp": "03:50:15", "text": "それについてあまり多くの人が共有していない"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13818.309, "timestamp": "03:50:18", "text": "彼らの経験や物事は、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13824.07, "timestamp": "03:50:24", "text": "ええ、NDAがあるので共有できません"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13826.63, "timestamp": "03:50:26", "text": "護衛やその他諸々"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13829.269, "timestamp": "03:50:29", "text": "彼らの経験を共有する"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13831.79, "timestamp": "03:50:31", "text": "経験、経験、そしてそういうもの"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13834.15, "timestamp": "03:50:34", "text": "コラボレーションはありましたか？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13837.189, "timestamp": "03:50:37", "text": "君は知らないだろう、私は間接的にたくさんプレイした"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13838.99, "timestamp": "03:50:38", "text": "と"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13841.99, "timestamp": "03:50:41", "text": "彼女。コラボレーションは一度もありません。最初は"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13845.229, "timestamp": "03:50:45", "text": "彼女とコラボレーションする"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13848.07, "timestamp": "03:50:48", "text": "実は。彼女とは話したりもしたよ。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13851.07, "timestamp": "03:50:51", "text": "彼女とコラボレーションしたかった"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13853.83, "timestamp": "03:50:5